A note on what leaves the device
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Of the components above, exactly one processes a scan outside the application's
own process: the Google Play Services Code Scanner, which opens its own screen.
That is disclosed to users in docs/legal/privacy.md and docs/legal/privacidad.md.

Everything else decodes in-process. The application declares no INTERNET
permission and ships no network client; see SECURITY.md.
